  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NAMATENGA_INTEGRATED RURAL DEVELOPMENT</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE PROJ AIMS AT DEVELOPING THE NORTHERN PART OF NAMENTEGA PROVINCE BY PROVIDING ACTIVITIES IN THE PRIMARY SECTOR TO THE POPULATION AS WELL AS SOCIAL SUPPORTING INFRASTRUCTURE. THE PROJ WILL IMPROVE AND SECURE THE AGRICULTURAL AND LIVESTOCK PRODUCTION. IT WILL INCREASE FARMERS INCOME AND IMPROVE THEIR HEALTH  THIER SCHOOL ENROLLMENT RATIO. ORDER TO IMPROVE THEIR LIVING CONDITIONS</narrative>
  </description>
